### Camera setup
- **Laptop webcam:** works out of the box (`cv2.VideoCapture(0)`)
- **Phone as webcam:** install [DroidCam](https://www.dev47apps.com/) or [Iriun Webcam](https://iriun.com/) on your phone and the matching desktop client. Try indices `0`, `1`, `2`.
- **Video file fallback:** pass a file path to `cv2.VideoCapture("video.mp4")` — the same code works for both.

> **Note:** Run Task 3 locally, not in Google Colab. Colab cannot access your camera.

